    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109317" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτᾰγή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>subordination, subjection,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				9.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὑποταγῇ</span> in a
